<title>USA: Indium Corp of America raises price to $225/kilo.</title>
<headline>Indium Corp of America raises price to $225/kilo.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indium Corp of America said it has raised its indium price by $15.00 to $225.00 per kilogram or $7.00 per troy ounce, effective Feb 26.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
